  "terms_summary": "CMU allows use in research and commercially sold products. It does not allow selling the motion data itself, including converted raw data. Bruce Hahne adds no restrictions to the BVH conversion. This project uses short retargeted clips within its animated granadero; source files are preserved as development provenance.",
  "adaptation": "Native MakeHuman joint positions and lengths are preserved. Hands, fingers, weapon contacts, prone crawl support, mounted seat, gestures, and period reload phases are authored. Fall and recovery use recorded body movement. Source joint recordings have no captured fingers. Animation markers are visual timing metadata, never simulation events."
